[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Goodbye and Good Luck]
[00:13.01]Where is Captain Alison going and how?
[00:19.94]Our neighbour, Captain Charles Alison, will sail from Portsmouth tomorrow.
[00:27.59]We'll meet him at the harbour early in the morning.
[00:32.05]He will be in his small boat, Topsail.
[00:36.75]Topsail is a famous little boat.
[00:40.27]It has sailed across the Atlantic many times.
[00:45.70]Captain Alison will set out at eight o'clock,
[00:50.17]so we'll have plenty of time.
[00:53.35]We'll see his boat and then we'll say goodbye to him.
[00:58.04]He will be away for two months.
[01:01.04]We are very proud of him.
[01:03.82]He will take part in an important race across the Atlantic.
